Whisper Base Slo Artur (full fine-tune)
Source: https://huggingface.co/blko/whisper-base-sl-artur-full-ft (Apache-2.0)
Based on OpenAI Whisper base: https://github.com/openai/whisper (MIT)
Fine-tuned on the ARTUR 1.0 Slovenian speech corpus:
  Verdonik, Darinka et al., ASR database ARTUR 1.0 (audio), Slovenian language resource repository CLARIN.SI,
  http://hdl.handle.net/11356/1776, licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).

Changes made for AON:
- exported to ONNX (encoder, merged decoder with past key values);
- cache_position computed inside the decoder graph instead of being an input;
- weights quantized to 8-bit (dynamic, unsigned) for use in the browser;
- generation_config.json taken from openai/whisper-base (multilingual language and task tokens).
